[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4120231619","pull_request_review_id":5336140092,"id":4120231619,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc71lb7D","diff_hunk":"@@ -1785,7 +1784,7 @@ Variant GDScriptFunction::call(GDScriptInstance *p_instance, const Variant **p_a\n \n \t\t\tOPCODE(OPCODE_CONSTRUCT_ARRAY) {\n \t\t\t\tLOAD_INSTRUCTION_ARGS\n-\t\t\t\tCHECK_SPACE(1 + instr_arg_count);\n+\t\t\t\tCHECK_SPACE(2 + instr_arg_count);","path":"modules/gdscript/gdscript_vm.cpp","commit_id":"b445ddc9e107a790f0b31fd89d1327379da3e6db","original_commit_id":"b445ddc9e107a790f0b31fd89d1327379da3e6db","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Feel free to correct me, but this seems to be still off by one.\n\nThe layout of `OPCODE_CONSTRUCT_ARRAY` is as follows:\n\n```\n                                                 ________________________\n                                                 vvvvvvvvvvvvvvv         |\n| OPCODE_CONSTRUCT_ARRAY | instruction_arg_count | ...elements | dst | argc\n                                      |__________^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\ninstruction_arg_count does not include the final argc, so there are 3 additional spaces.\n```\n\nNotice that `LOAD_INSTRUCTION_ARGS` does increment `ip` by one. So the same off by one probably applies to the other `LOAD_INSTRUCTION_ARGS` opcodes.","created_at":"2026-09-28T08:52:30Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T09:08:44Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103995#discussion_r4120231619","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103995","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4120231619"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103995#discussion_r4120231619"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103995"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4120231619/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":1787,"original_line":1787,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":105,"position":105,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4121249945","pull_request_review_id":5337442017,"id":4121249945,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc71pUiZ","diff_hunk":"@@ -1785,7 +1784,7 @@ Variant GDScriptFunction::call(GDScriptInstance *p_instance, const Variant **p_a\n \n \t\t\tOPCODE(OPCODE_CONSTRUCT_ARRAY) {\n \t\t\t\tLOAD_INSTRUCTION_ARGS\n-\t\t\t\tCHECK_SPACE(1 + instr_arg_count);\n+\t\t\t\tCHECK_SPACE(2 + instr_arg_count);","path":"modules/gdscript/gdscript_vm.cpp","commit_id":"b445ddc9e107a790f0b31fd89d1327379da3e6db","original_commit_id":"b445ddc9e107a790f0b31fd89d1327379da3e6db","user":{"login":"Macksaur","id":86566939,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NTY2OTM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86566939?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur","html_url":"https://github.com/Macksaur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I believe my original line of thought (it's been a minute) went like this; after much staring at the VM, I discovered this:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nvoid GDScriptByteCodeGenerator::write_construct_array(const Address &p_target, const Vector<Address> &p_arguments) {\r\n\tappend_opcode_and_argcount(GDScriptFunction::OPCODE_CONSTRUCT_ARRAY, 1 + p_arguments.size());\r\n\tfor (int i = 0; i < p_arguments.size(); i++) {\r\n\t\tappend(p_arguments[i]);\r\n\t}\r\n\tCallTarget ct = get_call_target(p_target);\r\n\tappend(ct.target);\r\n\tappend(p_arguments.size()); // this is redundant and should be deleted\r\n\tct.cleanup();\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nInferring `argc` from the instruction would be more correct, and I experimented with it on my fork (it definitely has savings).\r\n\r\nBut well, that change, it requires are a bit more than just increasing the bounds to their correct values. I wasn't sure how such a change would be received.\r\n\r\nSo a pin for later/salvage/possible future routes:\r\n- Clean up redundancy in emitted opcodes; args know their shape\r\n- Drop `CHECK_SPACE` in favour of some kind of `CHECKED_READ`(?) (checks every access of `_code_ptr[ip + x]`, rather than a single possibly incorrect magic number bounds check)","created_at":"2026-09-28T10:47:32Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T11:00:37Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103995#discussion_r4121249945","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103995","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4121249945"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103995#discussion_r4121249945"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103995"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4121249945/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":1787,"original_line":1787,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":4120231619,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":105,"position":105,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4121376382","pull_request_review_id":5337589443,"id":4121376382,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc71pzZ-","diff_hunk":"@@ -1785,7 +1784,7 @@ Variant GDScriptFunction::call(GDScriptInstance *p_instance, const Variant **p_a\n \n \t\t\tOPCODE(OPCODE_CONSTRUCT_ARRAY) {\n \t\t\t\tLOAD_INSTRUCTION_ARGS\n-\t\t\t\tCHECK_SPACE(1 + instr_arg_count);\n+\t\t\t\tCHECK_SPACE(2 + instr_arg_count);","path":"modules/gdscript/gdscript_vm.cpp","commit_id":"b445ddc9e107a790f0b31fd89d1327379da3e6db","original_commit_id":"b445ddc9e107a790f0b31fd89d1327379da3e6db","user":{"login":"Macksaur","id":86566939,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NTY2OTM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86566939?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur","html_url":"https://github.com/Macksaur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I thought I could sneak this in at lunch 😂 this is very fiddly and I originally spent a lot of time with it. I was sure of this a year ago when I made the change, but it's been too long that you could convince me otherwise now that I am wrong. Honestly, I'd really like a `CHECKED_READ` heh.\r\n\r\nFor `OPCODE_CONSTRUCT_ARRAY` you can see `LOAD_INSTRUCTION_ARGS` has +1 when it wrote the opcode for `instruction_arg_count`; it's very obscure. But `CHECK_SPACE(2 + instr_arg_count)` \\*should\\* be correct. No?","created_at":"2026-09-28T11:04:00Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T11:04:00Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103995#discussion_r4121376382","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103995","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4121376382"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103995#discussion_r4121376382"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103995"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4121376382/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":1787,"original_line":1787,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":4120231619,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":105,"position":105,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4121376591","pull_request_review_id":5337589705,"id":4121376591,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc71pzdP","diff_hunk":"@@ -1785,7 +1784,7 @@ Variant GDScriptFunction::call(GDScriptInstance *p_instance, const Variant **p_a\n \n \t\t\tOPCODE(OPCODE_CONSTRUCT_ARRAY) {\n \t\t\t\tLOAD_INSTRUCTION_ARGS\n-\t\t\t\tCHECK_SPACE(1 + instr_arg_count);\n+\t\t\t\tCHECK_SPACE(2 + instr_arg_count);","path":"modules/gdscript/gdscript_vm.cpp","commit_id":"b445ddc9e107a790f0b31fd89d1327379da3e6db","original_commit_id":"b445ddc9e107a790f0b31fd89d1327379da3e6db","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Wait nevermind. While my reasoning about the total size is correct, I think I did not consider that `CHECK_SPACE` is placed after `LOAD_INSTRUCTION_ARGS`. So it cancels out with `ip += 1`.","created_at":"2026-09-28T11:04:01Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T11:04:02Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103995#discussion_r4121376591","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103995","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4121376591"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103995#discussion_r4121376591"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103995"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4121376591/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":1787,"original_line":1787,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":4120231619,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":105,"position":105,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4121432319","pull_request_review_id":5337662278,"id":4121432319,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc71qBD_","diff_hunk":"@@ -1785,7 +1784,7 @@ Variant GDScriptFunction::call(GDScriptInstance *p_instance, const Variant **p_a\n \n \t\t\tOPCODE(OPCODE_CONSTRUCT_ARRAY) {\n \t\t\t\tLOAD_INSTRUCTION_ARGS\n-\t\t\t\tCHECK_SPACE(1 + instr_arg_count);\n+\t\t\t\tCHECK_SPACE(2 + instr_arg_count);","path":"modules/gdscript/gdscript_vm.cpp","commit_id":"b445ddc9e107a790f0b31fd89d1327379da3e6db","original_commit_id":"b445ddc9e107a790f0b31fd89d1327379da3e6db","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Great timing :sweat_smile: Yeah should be fine, marking as resolved. I'm on board with removing `argc` in the future. `CHECK_READ` seems not needed, `LOAD_INSTRUCTION_ARGS` should just include the necessary checks. If we then shift all variable length instruction args to the end of the opcode we should get pretty clear code using `CHECK_SPACE` for fixed stuff + `LOAD_INSTRUCTION_ARGS`.","created_at":"2026-09-28T11:10:17Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T11:10:18Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103995#discussion_r4121432319","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103995","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4121432319"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103995#discussion_r4121432319"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103995"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4121432319/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":1787,"original_line":1787,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":4120231619,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":105,"position":105,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4131503923","pull_request_review_id":5350056517,"id":4131503923,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc72Qb8z","diff_hunk":"@@ -3043,7 +3043,7 @@ Variant GDScriptFunction::call(GDScriptInstance *p_instance, const Variant **p_a\n \t\t\t}\n \n \t\t\tOPCODE(OPCODE_ITERATE_BEGIN) {\n-\t\t\t\tCHECK_SPACE(8); // Space for this and a regular iterate.\n+\t\t\t\tCHECK_SPACE(3 + 5); // Space for this and a regular iterate.","path":"modules/gdscript/gdscript_vm.cpp","commit_id":"b445ddc9e107a790f0b31fd89d1327379da3e6db","original_commit_id":"b445ddc9e107a790f0b31fd89d1327379da3e6db","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Bear with me again please. The layout here seems to be:\n\n```\n|OPCODE_ITERATE_BEGIN|counter|container|var|end of loop|\n|JMP|addr of loop body|\n|OPCODE_ITERATE|counter|container|var|jmpdst|\n```\n\nSo actually why are we checking the size of something else? Shouldn't `5` suffice? The jmp instruction is bound to check it's own size anyway. (E.g. `OPCODE_ITERATE_BEGIN_OBJECT` only checks that). Alternatively if we intend to check the entire loop head as the comment implies wouldn't that be `12`?","created_at":"2026-09-29T08:55:07Z","updated_at":"2026-09-29T08:59:39Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103995#discussion_r4131503923","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103995","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4131503923"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103995#discussion_r4131503923"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103995"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4131503923/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":3046,"original_line":3046,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":131,"position":131,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4133088681","pull_request_review_id":5352093805,"id":4133088681,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc72We2p","diff_hunk":"@@ -3043,7 +3043,7 @@ Variant GDScriptFunction::call(GDScriptInstance *p_instance, const Variant **p_a\n \t\t\t}\n \n \t\t\tOPCODE(OPCODE_ITERATE_BEGIN) {\n-\t\t\t\tCHECK_SPACE(8); // Space for this and a regular iterate.\n+\t\t\t\tCHECK_SPACE(3 + 5); // Space for this and a regular iterate.","path":"modules/gdscript/gdscript_vm.cpp","commit_id":"b445ddc9e107a790f0b31fd89d1327379da3e6db","original_commit_id":"b445ddc9e107a790f0b31fd89d1327379da3e6db","user":{"login":"Macksaur","id":86566939,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NTY2OTM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86566939?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur","html_url":"https://github.com/Macksaur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Yeah, these opcodes definitely have some upsetting shape requirements. Either `5`, or `7`, is fine in isolation. But `8`? Yes, the upsetting shape requirements. `OPCODE_ITERATE_BEGIN` requires the next opcode exist (after the jump), and as written it's implied to be `OPCODE_ITERATE`. So, `8` is stricter than `7` for malformed bytecode, it lets the next instruction check its own size like you'd expect, it just mandates it exists.\r\n\r\nI read the comment as \"space for this (begin + jump) and the start of the next opcode (iterate)\" but I think it is pretty gnarly. I didn't want to change the expectations here because it is a fragile verification that will let malformed bytecode through otherwise.\r\n\r\nYou can probably maybe loosen this to `5` but my PR only increased numbers 😅","created_at":"2026-09-29T11:52:46Z","updated_at":"2026-09-29T11:52:46Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103995#discussion_r4133088681","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103995","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4133088681"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103995#discussion_r4133088681"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103995"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4133088681/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":3046,"original_line":3046,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":4131503923,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":131,"position":131,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4133226321","pull_request_review_id":5352277673,"id":4133226321,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc72XAdR","diff_hunk":"@@ -3043,7 +3043,7 @@ Variant GDScriptFunction::call(GDScriptInstance *p_instance, const Variant **p_a\n \t\t\t}\n \n \t\t\tOPCODE(OPCODE_ITERATE_BEGIN) {\n-\t\t\t\tCHECK_SPACE(8); // Space for this and a regular iterate.\n+\t\t\t\tCHECK_SPACE(3 + 5); // Space for this and a regular iterate.","path":"modules/gdscript/gdscript_vm.cpp","commit_id":"b445ddc9e107a790f0b31fd89d1327379da3e6db","original_commit_id":"b445ddc9e107a790f0b31fd89d1327379da3e6db","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"All opcodes (except `OPCODE_END` and some jumps) expect the next opcode to exist, because they increase `ip` by their own size. I don't think we are checking this for any other opcodes are we?\r\n\r\nE.g. `OPCODE_ASSERT`\r\n\r\n```\r\nValid case:\r\n\r\n|OPCODE_ASSERT|test|message|OPCODE_END|\r\n     ^                           ^\r\n     |                           |\r\n     ip                          ip + 3\r\n\r\nCHECK_SPACE(3) -> (ip + 3) <= _code_size -> check passes\r\n\r\nWrong case:\r\n\r\n|OPCODE_ASSERT|test|message| <out of bounds>\r\n     ^                           ^\r\n     |                           |\r\n     ip                          ip + 3\r\n\r\nCHECK_SPACE(3) -> (ip + 3) <= _code_size -> check passes\r\n\r\n```\r\n","created_at":"2026-09-29T12:07:08Z","updated_at":"2026-09-29T12:07:27Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103995#discussion_r4133226321","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103995","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4133226321"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103995#discussion_r4133226321"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103995"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4133226321/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":3046,"original_line":3046,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":4131503923,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":131,"position":131,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4133485164","pull_request_review_id":5352637927,"id":4133485164,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc72X_ps","diff_hunk":"@@ -3043,7 +3043,7 @@ Variant GDScriptFunction::call(GDScriptInstance *p_instance, const Variant **p_a\n \t\t\t}\n \n \t\t\tOPCODE(OPCODE_ITERATE_BEGIN) {\n-\t\t\t\tCHECK_SPACE(8); // Space for this and a regular iterate.\n+\t\t\t\tCHECK_SPACE(3 + 5); // Space for this and a regular iterate.","path":"modules/gdscript/gdscript_vm.cpp","commit_id":"b445ddc9e107a790f0b31fd89d1327379da3e6db","original_commit_id":"b445ddc9e107a790f0b31fd89d1327379da3e6db","user":{"login":"Macksaur","id":86566939,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NTY2OTM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86566939?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur","html_url":"https://github.com/Macksaur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Yeah, I believe this case is unique. It is a more strict guarantee that \\*something\\* will execute after this instruction.\r\n\r\nThe way I see it currently is that there was an attempt at one point in time to verify the multipart shape, even if it was sort of in vain. I would be happy if the bounds shrunk to their immediate reads, it just didn't feel appropriate to do at that moment.\r\n\r\nLikely my quibble here is trivial, and I'm there with you, I don't like it, but increasing coverage was my only goal so I did not reduce it. Loosening the checks comes with other fallout vs. trivial safety benefits.","created_at":"2026-09-29T12:33:41Z","updated_at":"2026-09-29T12:33:42Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103995#discussion_r4133485164","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103995","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4133485164"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103995#discussion_r4133485164"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103995"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4133485164/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":3046,"original_line":3046,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":4131503923,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":131,"position":131,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4133681697","pull_request_review_id":5352872866,"id":4133681697,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc72Yvoh","diff_hunk":"@@ -3043,7 +3043,7 @@ Variant GDScriptFunction::call(GDScriptInstance *p_instance, const Variant **p_a\n \t\t\t}\n \n \t\t\tOPCODE(OPCODE_ITERATE_BEGIN) {\n-\t\t\t\tCHECK_SPACE(8); // Space for this and a regular iterate.\n+\t\t\t\tCHECK_SPACE(3 + 5); // Space for this and a regular iterate.","path":"modules/gdscript/gdscript_vm.cpp","commit_id":"b445ddc9e107a790f0b31fd89d1327379da3e6db","original_commit_id":"b445ddc9e107a790f0b31fd89d1327379da3e6db","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I'd suggest we do 7 then for ITERATE and JMP. But `5 + 3` is misleading in anycase.","created_at":"2026-09-29T12:54:39Z","updated_at":"2026-09-29T12:56:03Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103995#discussion_r4133681697","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103995","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4133681697"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103995#discussion_r4133681697"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103995"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4133681697/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":3046,"original_line":3046,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":4131503923,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":131,"position":131,"subject_type":"line"}]